ives change as the injured father of one of Kenta's classmates returns from the battlefield and news of more casualties arrives in the village.\n\n(Source: Anime News Network)"},"tags":[{"name":"Historical","rank":50,"spoiler":false}],"titles":{"display":"Aoi Hitomi no Onnanoko no Ohanashi","english":null,"native":"青い瞳の女の子のお話","romaji":"Aoi Hitomi no Onnanoko no Ohanashi","synonyms":[{"language":"zh","source":"bangumi","value":"青瞳少女的故事"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"'09戦争童話 青い瞳の女の子のお話"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"The Story of the Blue-Eyed Girl"}]},"trailer":null,"visibility":"general"}